Subject: libdsm: use poll for POSIX NetBIOS sockets and abort pipes

Avoid indexing fixed-size fd_set objects with valid descriptors >= 1024.
Keep finite receive timeouts and cancellation wakeups across all NetBIOS waits.
Windows keeps its socket-handle based select implementation.

